<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Aiventix — AI Procesautomatisering voor MKB</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg: #0B0A09;
    --card: #161412;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --text: #F5F4F2;
    --muted: #8F8A84;
    --orange: #F4622E;
    --orange-bg: rgba(244,98,46,0.06);
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 17px;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ANIMATED BACKGROUND */
  .bg-canvas {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .grid-bg {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .orb {
    position: fixed;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(80px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .orb-1 {
    width: 600px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    top: -200px; right: -200px;
    animation: float1 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .orb-2 {
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
    bottom: 20%; left: -100px;
    animation: float2 11s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float1 {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    50% { transform: translate(-40px, 40px); }
  }
  @keyframes float2 {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    50% { transform: translate(30px, -30px); }
  }

  /* All content above bg */
  nav, main, footer { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(11,10,9,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    height: 68px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 9px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .logo-wordmark {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .logo-wordmark span { color: var(--orange); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 10px 22px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.85; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* FADE IN ANIMATIONS */
  .fade-up {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }
  .fade-up.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .fade-up-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
  .fade-up-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
  .fade-up-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
  .fade-up-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    padding: 180px 0 100px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before, .eyebrow::after {
    content: '';
    width: 32px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--orange);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .hero-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .hero-logo-icon {
    width: 80px; height: 80px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(244,98,46,0.35);
    animation: pulse-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse-glow {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(244,98,46,0.3); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(244,98,46,0.5); }
  }
  .hero-logo-wordmark {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .hero-logo-wordmark span { color: var(--orange); }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }
  .hero h1 .orange { color: var(--orange); }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .hero-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(244,98,46,0.35);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { color: var(--text); }

  /* STATS */
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 80px;
  }
  .stat {
    background: var(--card);
    padding: 36px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .stat:hover { background: #1a1714; }
  .stat-num {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--orange);
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SECTION */
  section { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 520px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* DIVIDER */
  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 0; }

  /* PROBLEMS */
  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 52px;
  }
  .problem-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .problem-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(244,98,46,0.3);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .problem-card .icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    background: var(--orange-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(244,98,46,0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .problem-card:hover .icon {
    background: rgba(244,98,46,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(244,98,46,0.4);
  }
  .problem-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .problem-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* STEPS */
  .steps-list {
    margin-top: 52px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 36px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: padding-left 0.3s;
  }
  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .step:hover { padding-left: 8px; }
  .step-num {
    width: 42px; height: 42px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--orange);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .step:hover .step-num {
    background: var(--orange-bg);
    border-color: rgba(244,98,46,0.3);
  }
  .step h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .step p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* OFFER */
  .offer-box {
    margin-top: 52px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .offer-box::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px; right: -60px;
    width: 240px; height: 240px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .offer-header {
    background: var(--orange-bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244,98,46,0.12);
    padding: 28px 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .offer-header h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .offer-badge {
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .offer-body { padding: 40px; }
  .offer-items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .offer-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .offer-check {
    width: 22px; height: 22px;
    background: var(--orange-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(244,98,46,0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--orange);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .offer-item p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .offer-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .offer-price { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .offer-price strong {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .offer-price .free {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  /* ABOUT */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 52px;
  }
  .about-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .about-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-text strong { color: var(--text); }
  .about-stats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .about-stat {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .about-stat:hover {
    border-color: rgba(244,98,46,0.3);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .about-stat-num {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--orange);
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 64px;
  }
  .about-stat-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* CTA SECTION */
  .cta-section { text-align: center; }
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 64px 48px 48px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-box::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    animation: float1 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .cta-box::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -100px; left: -100px;
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
    animation: float2 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .cta-box h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .cta-box p {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .cta-box .btn-primary { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cta-note {
    margin-top: 48px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .calendly-wrap {
    margin-top: 48px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 36px 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .footer-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ORANGE STRIPE */
  .orange-stripe { height: 4px; background: var(--orange); width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* SCROLL INDICATOR */
  .scroll-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 32px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px); }
  }
  .scroll-arrow {
    width: 20px; height: 20px;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--muted);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--muted);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* PARTICLES */
  #particle-canvas {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* CURSOR GLOW */
  .cursor-glow {
    position: fixed;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,98,46,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }

  /* GLOW CARD BORDER */
  .problem-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .problem-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: -1px;
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(244,98,46,0) 0%, rgba(244,98,46,0.3) 50%, rgba(244,98,46,0) 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .problem-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .problem-card > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* ANIMATED UNDERLINE on section labels */
  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  /* GLOWING STEP NUMBERS on hover */
  .step:hover .step-num {
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(244,98,46,0.4);
  }

  /* SCAN line animation on offer box */
  @keyframes scan {
    0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }
    100% { transform: translateY(400%); }
  }
  .offer-box::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(244,98,46,0.4), transparent);
    animation: scan 4s linear infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* COUNTER ANIMATION */
  .count-up { display: inline-block; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .offer-items { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .hero { padding: 140px 0 80px; }
    .cta-box { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .offer-body { padding: 24px; }
    .hero-logo-wordmark { font-size: 40px; }
    .hero-logo-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- BACKGROUND -->
<canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>
<div class="cursor-glow" id="cursorGlow"></div>
<div class="grid-bg"></div>
<div class="orb orb-1"></div>
<div class="orb orb-2"></div>

<div class="orange-stripe"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo">
      <div class="logo-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <path d="M12 3L22 20H2L12 3Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          <line x1="6.5" y1="14" x2="17.5" y2="14" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="3" r="2" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-wordmark"><span>Ai</span>ventix</div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://calendly.com/dhoving147/strategy-call" target="_blank" class="nav-cta">Gratis AI Scan →</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow fade-up">AI Procesautomatisering voor MKB</div>

    <div class="hero-logo fade-up fade-up-delay-1">
      <div class="hero-logo-icon">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
          <path d="M24 7L43 40H5L24 7Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          <line x1="13" y1="29" x2="35" y2="29" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="7" r="4" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-logo-wordmark"><span>Ai</span>ventix</div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-delay-2">Stop tijd te verliezen aan werk<br>dat een <span class="orange">systeem kan doen</span></h1>
    <p class="fade-up fade-up-delay-3">Ik breng in kaart waar jouw bedrijf uren en euro's laat liggen en automatiseer het met AI.</p>

    <div class="hero-cta fade-up fade-up-delay-4">
      <a href="https://calendly.com/dhoving147/strategy-call" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Plan een gratis AI Scan →</a>
      <a href="#hoe-het-werkt" class="btn-secondary">Hoe werkt het? ↓</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats fade-up fade-up-delay-4">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">4-10u</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Gemiddeld verlies per medewerker per week aan handmatig werk</div>
